# __NAME__

Game server scaffolded from [moke-kit](https://github.com/GStones/moke-kit) via the `create-game` skill.

Module: `__MODULE__`

## Run

```bash
docker compose -f ./deployment/docker-compose/infrastructure.yaml up -d
buf generate
go run ./cmd/__NAME__/service/main.go
```

## Client

```bash
go build -o __NAME__ ./cmd/__NAME__/client/main.go
./__NAME__ grpc
```

HTTP gateway: `POST http://localhost:8081/v1/hello/hi`

## Compose modules

`cmd/__NAME__/service/main.go` wires moke-kit infra + `pkg/modules.AllModule` (gRPC, gateway, TCP).
Add platform modules only when you need shared services.
